WEBVTT

00:01:39.380 --> 00:01:40.770
The path splits.

00:01:41.270 --> 00:01:42.480
Which one do we take?

00:01:43.090 --> 00:01:45.760
Let's take the lazy way and split up.

00:01:45.760 --> 00:01:46.710
Very well!

00:01:47.270 --> 00:01:50.220
Tenma-dono and I will take this way.

00:01:50.220 --> 00:01:52.160
Let's go, Tenma-dono.

00:01:52.670 --> 00:01:53.920
W-Wait...

00:01:54.200 --> 00:01:55.800
Stupid Tsukishima!

00:01:59.340 --> 00:02:01.930
<b>Who Is Righteous!? 
Tenma and Justice!</b>

00:02:02.320 --> 00:02:03.340
Jeez.

00:02:04.030 --> 00:02:05.060
You okay with this?

00:02:05.420 --> 00:02:06.480
We do not have a choice.

00:02:06.880 --> 00:02:08.160
Let's go this way.

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:14.480
Three of the Ten Crucifix Insects are left, right?

00:02:14.960 --> 00:02:16.000
Yeah.

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:18.510
Sarutobi Sasuke, the first one we killed.

00:02:18.510 --> 00:02:19.770
Then Unno Rokurou.

00:02:19.770 --> 00:02:21.150
Mochidzuki Rokurou.

00:02:21.150 --> 00:02:22.860
Nedzu Jinpachi.

00:02:22.860 --> 00:02:25.870
Also, Kirigakure Saizou, whom I defeated.

00:02:25.870 --> 00:02:30.470
And Miyoshi Seikai Nyuudou 
and Miyoshi Isa Nyuudou.

00:02:31.970 --> 00:02:36.330
I wonder who'll be next.

00:02:37.240 --> 00:02:38.370
I can't wait.

00:02:38.910 --> 00:02:40.630
Let's keep our guard up.

00:02:42.810 --> 00:02:43.820
Yukimura-sama...

00:02:45.320 --> 00:02:47.780
The Nyuudou two have fallen.

00:02:48.520 --> 00:02:50.060
Then four remain?

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:51.800
I'm sorry, sir.

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:56.070
Surely, you won't lose any more...

00:02:56.900 --> 00:02:58.070
As you wish, sir.

00:03:24.170 --> 00:03:27.780
T-Tsukishima, y-you don't have to go so fast.

00:03:27.780 --> 00:03:29.640
No, I do!

00:03:29.640 --> 00:03:32.310
We must reach the top of the 
castle with all possible haste!

00:03:32.310 --> 00:03:33.770
Hey, wait.

00:03:37.060 --> 00:03:38.300
Tenma-dono?

00:03:38.640 --> 00:03:42.300
I d-don't want you getting lost.

00:03:43.610 --> 00:03:45.310
Are you in here, Insect-Men?

00:03:47.550 --> 00:03:52.500
L-Loud sounds kind of scare me, 
so please keep it down.

00:03:53.780 --> 00:03:54.910
Or maybe here?

00:03:56.430 --> 00:03:57.520
This is it!

00:03:57.520 --> 00:03:59.700
Let's go, Tenma-dono.

00:03:59.700 --> 00:04:01.010
No! No! No! No!

00:04:01.360 --> 00:04:03.030
Where are you, Insect-men?

00:04:03.880 --> 00:04:04.800
No way!

00:04:05.350 --> 00:04:10.520
Tenma-dono, are you scared of everything?

00:04:12.750 --> 00:04:16.020
J-Just for now... I'll be fine soon!

00:04:16.390 --> 00:04:19.340
What? That's splendid thinking!

00:04:19.810 --> 00:04:26.030
With that thought in mind, 
you'll be able to overcome any fear.

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:28.330
O-Of course.

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:30.330
I can do this.

00:04:30.720 --> 00:04:36.420
I'll be okay with insects, cramped spaces, 
high places, or dark spaces...

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:40.800
And I'll be the best onmyodo in Japan.

00:04:42.380 --> 00:04:44.680
For my mother and father.

00:04:47.270 --> 00:04:48.680
Tenma-dono...

00:04:49.460 --> 00:04:51.430
H-Hey...

00:04:52.100 --> 00:04:56.520
Do you ever think of your mom and dad?

00:04:56.520 --> 00:04:57.810
Of course!

00:04:58.290 --> 00:05:01.590
My father invented the 
Tsukishima-style of swordsmanship,

00:05:01.590 --> 00:05:03.820
and he's the man I admire most!

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:06.950
Oh, that really annoying guy.

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:08.360
My mother...

00:05:09.310 --> 00:05:12.190
She died soon after I was born.

00:05:13.380 --> 00:05:14.460
I see.

00:05:15.070 --> 00:05:18.830
What are your parents like?

00:05:21.160 --> 00:05:23.340
My father, well...

00:05:23.850 --> 00:05:26.340
My father is big and strong.

00:05:26.920 --> 00:05:30.830
And my mother is really pretty 
and good at sewing.

00:05:31.670 --> 00:05:35.100
And both of them are always thinking of me...

00:05:39.180 --> 00:05:41.860
But I've never met them.

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:43.120
What?

00:05:43.890 --> 00:05:46.610
When I was really little, we were separated.

00:05:47.540 --> 00:05:51.530
I don't even remember their faces...

00:05:52.020 --> 00:05:57.990
Then they must be really looking 
forward to meeting you.

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:01.240
You think so?

00:06:01.830 --> 00:06:03.010
You're right...

00:06:03.010 --> 00:06:05.380
They're my mother and father, right?

00:06:06.080 --> 00:06:06.880
Right!

00:06:09.180 --> 00:06:11.260
I need to do my best.

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:12.880
I need to be a good kid.

00:06:12.880 --> 00:06:14.390
That's right, Tenma-dono!

00:06:15.700 --> 00:06:18.390
I'll defeat the Insect-men!

00:06:25.420 --> 00:06:27.150
<b>Life</b>

00:06:28.070 --> 00:06:29.190
Justice.

00:06:30.560 --> 00:06:33.910
My name is Anayama "Justice" Kosuke.

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:37.040
Uh, what's "justice"?

00:06:39.550 --> 00:06:42.540
Justice is that which is righteous.

00:06:43.890 --> 00:06:48.300
The flames of justice burn within me.

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:53.500
Come inside, Ichinotani Tenma.

00:06:53.930 --> 00:06:55.810
I shall teach you of justice.

00:06:56.630 --> 00:06:59.160
M-Me?

00:06:59.160 --> 00:07:02.800
Tenma-dono, this is the chance of a lifetime.

00:07:02.800 --> 00:07:06.980
Let's show them what you can do!

00:07:06.980 --> 00:07:08.320
Uh, really?

00:07:08.690 --> 00:07:09.570
Really!

00:07:09.770 --> 00:07:10.820
Really?

00:07:11.800 --> 00:07:13.200
O-Of course.

00:07:13.470 --> 00:07:15.580
<i>I should have kept my mouth shut!</i>

00:07:15.940 --> 00:07:19.080
Then let us have a fair fight.

00:07:21.230 --> 00:07:22.580
<i>I can do this!</i>

00:07:24.490 --> 00:07:26.170
<i>Do my bidding!</i>

00:07:36.550 --> 00:07:39.700
I'm sure that sound is 
Hibachi-neesama and her friends.

00:07:39.700 --> 00:07:41.450
Then we should hurry.

00:07:41.450 --> 00:07:42.540
Yes.

00:07:43.410 --> 00:07:46.400
The Moon Group must do its job, too.

00:07:48.110 --> 00:07:49.760
Justice!

00:07:49.760 --> 00:07:50.610
Tamekichi...

00:07:51.260 --> 00:07:52.180
<b>Speed</b>

00:07:54.330 --> 00:07:56.660
<i>Full-Power Slap Combo!</i>

00:07:58.660 --> 00:07:59.800
Matsukichi...

00:08:00.180 --> 00:08:01.430
<b>Strength</b>

00:08:04.470 --> 00:08:06.630
<i>Full-Power Mega-Slap!</i>

00:08:10.530 --> 00:08:11.760
What?

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:14.680
Your shikigami are much more 
powerful than last time.

00:08:15.380 --> 00:08:18.200
<i>Tamekichi is the fast one, 
so he locks down the enemy...</i>

00:08:18.200 --> 00:08:20.930
<i>And Matsukichi, the strong one, finishes it...</i>

00:08:21.550 --> 00:08:26.620
<i>They're both stronger and tougher than before!</i>

00:08:27.280 --> 00:08:30.190
<i>No one is stronger than I am!</i>

00:08:30.190 --> 00:08:31.840
<i>Full-Power Slap!</i>

00:08:43.030 --> 00:08:45.170
<i>It's really strong...</i>

00:08:45.680 --> 00:08:47.600
<i>But I can't run!</i>

00:08:47.600 --> 00:08:49.750
<i>Because I can do this.</i>

00:08:52.900 --> 00:08:56.300
Justice!

00:08:54.370 --> 00:08:55.260
Tenma-dono!

00:08:58.530 --> 00:09:00.010
Tenma-dono!

00:09:10.600 --> 00:09:11.770
What?

00:09:14.620 --> 00:09:16.300
One justice.

00:09:16.300 --> 00:09:18.620
Justice is power.

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:22.750
U-Um...

00:09:22.750 --> 00:09:25.360
Why did you save me?

00:09:26.690 --> 00:09:29.630
You don't have the right to die yet.

00:09:32.090 --> 00:09:34.560
Now let us fight...

00:09:35.060 --> 00:09:37.260
Wh-What is that stance?

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:43.580
fair and square!

00:09:46.550 --> 00:09:48.770
H-He's too fast to see!

00:09:50.160 --> 00:09:52.650
Justice!

00:10:04.740 --> 00:10:07.740
Pain is also a path to justice.

00:10:07.740 --> 00:10:10.170
That makes two justices...

00:10:12.020 --> 00:10:13.900
Y-You're making fun of me!

00:10:13.900 --> 00:10:15.240
I can fight, too!

00:10:15.240 --> 00:10:17.010
Matsukichi! Tamekichi!

00:10:21.900 --> 00:10:22.720
I'm not done yet!

00:10:27.040 --> 00:10:28.000
Matsukichi!

00:10:34.760 --> 00:10:35.680
Well?

00:10:35.680 --> 00:10:37.270
What?

00:10:37.270 --> 00:10:40.370
Tenma-dono, how much have you trained?

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:49.750
That was an excellent attack, Ichinotani Tenma.

00:10:51.730 --> 00:10:55.120
Your speed and power are greater than before.

00:10:55.630 --> 00:10:57.970
Just keep at it...

00:10:58.570 --> 00:11:00.110
And you'll be able to die.

00:11:01.120 --> 00:11:06.520
Now, let us ascend the eternal 
staircase to justice!

00:11:09.520 --> 00:11:10.960
The path splits.

00:11:12.130 --> 00:11:13.540
Which way do we go?

00:11:15.500 --> 00:11:17.160
This way, Yamagata.

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:18.810
Princess...

00:11:19.520 --> 00:11:20.780
It's this way.

00:11:20.780 --> 00:11:22.010
It isn't far.

00:11:30.420 --> 00:11:31.540
<i>I understand.</i>

00:11:32.050 --> 00:11:36.920
<i>Something lies ahead that can 
restore the princess's power.</i>

00:11:43.810 --> 00:11:48.110
Ichinotani Tenma, there's no 
need for tears in justice.

00:11:48.110 --> 00:11:50.190
I'm n-not crying...

00:11:50.190 --> 00:11:53.740
Not lying is the path to justice!

00:11:55.060 --> 00:11:56.440
Matsukichi! Tamekichi!

00:11:57.970 --> 00:12:00.760
Stop trying to rely on violence.

00:12:00.760 --> 00:12:04.700
Justice says people can understand 
one another by speaking.

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:08.880
And my fists are speaking of justice!

00:12:12.450 --> 00:12:14.870
Justice doesn't make a mess.

00:12:16.150 --> 00:12:18.710
Did you justice-brush your teeth?

00:12:19.330 --> 00:12:22.220
Did you justice-eat all your veggies?

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:25.720
Do you greet people properly with justice?

00:12:26.430 --> 00:12:28.470
Early to bed, early to rise, makes a man justice!

00:12:30.780 --> 00:12:35.480
It seems you understand nothing of justice...

00:12:36.140 --> 00:12:41.350
Ichinotani Tenma, I shall tell you 
the three core tenants of justice.

00:12:42.130 --> 00:12:44.630
First up.

00:12:48.020 --> 00:12:50.670
Justice must be strong.

00:12:53.340 --> 00:12:56.250
Heart, technique, body.

00:12:56.250 --> 00:12:59.750
All of them must be strong for justice.

00:12:59.750 --> 00:13:01.160
What?

00:13:01.160 --> 00:13:04.010
You're just beating him up!

00:13:04.010 --> 00:13:06.470
And the second!

00:13:08.050 --> 00:13:09.010
Tsukishima!

00:13:12.010 --> 00:13:14.270
Abandon your comrades.

00:13:16.570 --> 00:13:19.270
And abandon your family.

00:13:20.660 --> 00:13:21.890
Family...

00:13:22.820 --> 00:13:26.330
Ichinotani Tenma, did you not 
join the Insect Magistrate's

00:13:26.330 --> 00:13:29.330
in order to meet your parents?

00:13:29.330 --> 00:13:30.780
How did you know?

00:13:31.390 --> 00:13:34.540
Because I've always watched you.

00:13:35.150 --> 00:13:36.760
And I realized you,

00:13:36.760 --> 00:13:41.480
who rely on your friends, 
your shikigami, and family,

00:13:41.480 --> 00:13:46.300
are the boy I must instruct in the ways of justice.

00:13:46.670 --> 00:13:47.580
Listen...

00:13:47.580 --> 00:13:49.590
As long as you lean on those things,

00:13:49.590 --> 00:13:52.060
you can never attain true justice.

00:13:52.490 --> 00:13:56.680
Whatever binds you will keep you 
from the path of justice!

00:13:57.240 --> 00:14:00.180
And then, you throw away all hope.

00:14:05.770 --> 00:14:06.780
Tenma?

00:14:07.120 --> 00:14:09.220
That's wrong, Hibachi-dono.

00:14:09.220 --> 00:14:11.110
We have no time for worry.

00:14:11.110 --> 00:14:12.200
Let's hurry.

00:14:12.700 --> 00:14:14.200
I know that.

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:16.230
He'll be fine.

00:14:18.990 --> 00:14:20.000
<i>Tenma...</i>

00:14:21.910 --> 00:14:23.710
84 justices.

00:14:24.360 --> 00:14:26.400
85 justices.

00:14:27.290 --> 00:14:29.390
86 justices.

00:14:29.980 --> 00:14:31.810
That last one hurt, didn't it?

00:14:32.400 --> 00:14:36.750
I'll count it as three.

00:14:36.750 --> 00:14:39.730
That makes 89 justices.

00:14:40.430 --> 00:14:41.610
Splendid.

00:14:41.610 --> 00:14:45.920
My previous high score was 86 justices...

00:14:45.920 --> 00:14:47.630
A new record!

00:14:47.630 --> 00:14:54.610
Ichinotani Tenma, you and I will 
reach new heights of justice.

00:14:54.930 --> 00:14:57.500
Let's both do our best...

00:14:57.860 --> 00:15:00.900
Now, where was I?

00:15:00.900 --> 00:15:02.580
Oh, that's it.

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:05.000
The three tenants of justice, right?

00:15:05.450 --> 00:15:08.050
The third is very simple.

00:15:08.050 --> 00:15:10.510
I am justice!

00:15:11.140 --> 00:15:15.300
Well, Ichinotani Tenma, let's finish this.

00:15:15.300 --> 00:15:19.520
This will complete your justice through me.

00:15:19.960 --> 00:15:21.820
Admit your defeat,

00:15:21.820 --> 00:15:27.330
and say that I am the one true justice!

00:15:27.330 --> 00:15:30.030
If you do, you can die.

00:15:33.580 --> 00:15:34.700
<i>I can hear it.</i>

00:15:36.670 --> 00:15:38.030
<i>The sound of the waves.</i>

00:15:39.810 --> 00:15:41.790
<i>The well is just ahead.</i>

00:15:43.160 --> 00:15:44.540
<i>We'll be there soon.</i>

00:15:47.800 --> 00:15:49.530
<i>And then, I...</i>

00:15:50.880 --> 00:15:50.920
{eyecatch}

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:04.360
Now, let's finish this.

00:16:05.130 --> 00:16:07.940
Say it, and you can end this.

00:16:20.800 --> 00:16:22.620
I... I...

00:16:22.770 --> 00:16:24.120
Stop!

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:29.000
Don't say it, Tenma-dono...

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:33.000
You want to show your parents how 
hard you're trying, don't you?

00:16:42.620 --> 00:16:43.520
<i>I'm cold.</i>

00:16:54.340 --> 00:17:00.540
<i>Tenma, your parents spent three 
days and nights making these.</i>

00:17:02.630 --> 00:17:05.040
<i>My mother and father...</i>

00:17:09.050 --> 00:17:12.370
<i>Tenma, fulfill your duty as soon as you can.</i>

00:17:12.720 --> 00:17:17.170
<i>Your parents wanted to see you 
after you'd grown strong.</i>

00:17:31.210 --> 00:17:34.650
My father is big and strong...

00:17:35.360 --> 00:17:39.280
And my mother is really pretty 
and good at sewing.

00:17:39.860 --> 00:17:43.790
And both of them are always... 
Always thinking of me!

00:17:44.480 --> 00:17:49.590
And I'm going to see them!

00:17:51.880 --> 00:17:53.670
You still don't understand?

00:17:54.080 --> 00:17:58.430
As long as you rely on those things, 
you can never win!

00:17:59.820 --> 00:18:02.950
Whenever I think of my mother and father,

00:18:03.260 --> 00:18:04.930
my heart feels warm...

00:18:05.470 --> 00:18:07.300
It gives me power...

00:18:08.190 --> 00:18:12.670
That's why I won't lose!

00:18:17.730 --> 00:18:18.730
Tamekichi!

00:18:19.320 --> 00:18:20.310
Matsukichi!

00:18:21.180 --> 00:18:26.040
<i>Limiter Off! Transform!</i>

00:18:27.690 --> 00:18:28.710
<i>Combine!</i>

00:18:36.640 --> 00:18:38.710
<i>Great Yokodzuna Version!</i>

00:18:39.360 --> 00:18:40.340
What?

00:18:41.550 --> 00:18:43.600
<i>Target: Lock On.</i>

00:18:44.650 --> 00:18:46.600
<i>Auto-killer Mode!</i>

00:18:46.770 --> 00:18:48.040
Interesting.

00:18:48.040 --> 00:18:54.610
True justice lies in defeating absolute 
evil with absolute power.

00:18:55.230 --> 00:18:58.860
Roar, my justice!

00:18:59.120 --> 00:19:00.860
No, he's shedding his skin!

00:19:01.300 --> 00:19:04.620
I'll show you! This is my...

00:19:05.010 --> 00:19:08.120
<i>Full-Power Attack!</i>

00:19:08.120 --> 00:19:12.330
...true justice!

00:19:19.710 --> 00:19:25.720
I never knew... 
I never knew such justice existed!

00:19:39.010 --> 00:19:41.820
I can do it...

00:19:50.750 --> 00:19:52.720
Huh? I...

00:19:53.300 --> 00:19:56.380
Well done, Tenma.

00:19:57.510 --> 00:20:00.260
M-Mother?

00:20:01.710 --> 00:20:03.840
You've grown strong, Tenma.

00:20:04.240 --> 00:20:06.510
F-Father...

00:20:06.920 --> 00:20:09.720
We're very proud of you.

00:20:10.280 --> 00:20:14.020
We knew you could do it.

00:20:26.180 --> 00:20:28.460
You're awake, Tenma-dono?

00:20:28.460 --> 00:20:29.600
Tsukishima?

00:20:29.600 --> 00:20:31.540
That was a wonderful attack!

00:20:31.970 --> 00:20:34.510
You really are strong!

00:20:41.120 --> 00:20:42.600
T-Tenma-dono?

00:20:42.600 --> 00:20:43.300
I'll walk!

00:20:44.450 --> 00:20:46.620
<i>Father... Mother...</i>

00:20:46.620 --> 00:20:48.750
<i>Just wait a little longer.</i>

00:20:49.140 --> 00:20:52.850
<i>I'll get stronger! So I can do even more!</i>

00:20:53.310 --> 00:20:56.560
<i>So I can see you as soon as possible!</i>

00:21:16.750 --> 00:21:18.170
We've been waiting for you.

00:21:19.110 --> 00:21:22.870
<b>Ten Crucifix Insects 
Kakei Juuzou</b>

00:21:25.110 --> 00:21:29.590
<b>Ten Crucifix Insects 
Yuri Kamanosuke</b>

00:22:59.940 --> 00:23:02.020
This blizzard is too cold.

00:22:59.940 --> 00:23:02.310
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:02.020 --> 00:23:03.300
It's your time to shine, Hibachi-dono.

00:23:03.300 --> 00:23:04.900
To melt the snow with a bomb, right?

00:23:04.900 --> 00:23:07.550
No, use your loincloth to 
start a fire with friction!

00:23:07.550 --> 00:23:08.940
Rub rub... Wait, no!

00:23:10.230 --> 00:23:11.820
Next time, on <i>Mushibugyo</i>:

00:23:11.820 --> 00:23:14.000
My Life's Greatest Task.

00:23:12.070 --> 00:23:14.000
<b>My Life's Greatest Task</b>
